{"id":"wb-7-1103","name":"永福寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"永福寺塔","text":"永福寺塔位于中国江西省上饶市鄱阳县鄱阳镇土井巷，1957年及1987年先后两次被列为江西省文物保护单位，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n永福寺塔建于北宋天圣二年（1024年），塔为仿木楼阁式砖塔，八角九级，高49米。塔身八面建有拱卷门，柱枋上设斗拱。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B8%E7%A6%8F%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":85491272,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85491272","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0bf9aa61776f59e2bbc43466.jpg","title":"Poyang_Yongfu_Si_Ta_2017.11.25_10-04-37.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Poyang_Yongfu_Si_Ta_2017.11.25_10-04-37.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c0/Poyang_Yongfu_Si_Ta_2017.11.25_10-04-37.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"鄱阳·永福寺塔","width":320,"height":427}}